==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|сбить|-вать}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|сбива́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-сбивать.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|сбива́ть|impf|pf=сбить}}

# to [[knock down]], to [[shake down]], to [[cause]] [[to]] [[fall]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[сбива́ть спесь]] [[с]] [[кто-либо|кого́-либо]]|to [[take someone down a peg]], to [[cut someone down to size]]}}
# to [[knock down]], to [[beat down]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[сбива́ть це́ну]]|to [[beat down]] the [[price]]}}
# to [[put out]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[сбива́ть с та́кта]]|to [[to put out of time]]}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[сбива́ть со сле́да]]|to [[put off the scent]]}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[сбива́ть с то́лку]]|to [[bewilder]], to [[confuse]], to [[muddle]]}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[сбива́ть с пути́ и́стинного]]|to [[lead astray]]}}
# to [[tread down]]
# to [[knock together]]
# to [[churn]]
# ''(eggs, cream)'' to [[whisk]], to [[beat]], to [[whip]]

